---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /zh/
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1>道的文明，当代人的公共空间</h1>
  <p>这里不问出自哪部古籍、哪位名人，也不问门派、师承与宗教身份。<br>无论你来自道家、佛法、其他信仰，还是没有任何宗教背景——只要你能用现代的语言讲好道的智慧，并愿意守住“人权”与“共生”的底线，这里就有你的位置。</p>
  <p class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn" href="/zh/charter/">阅读《共道宪章》</a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="/zh/invite/">邀请函：加入我们</a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="/zh/download/">下载离线合集</a>
  </p>
</section>

<div class="columns">
  <section class="col">
    <h2>最新</h2>
    <p class="col-note">按发布时间排列</p>
    {% set list = collections.posts_zh | head(5) %}{% include "partials/post-list.njk" %}
    <p><a href="/zh/library/">全部文章 →</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="col">
    <h2>随机发现 <button type="button" class="tool-btn small" id="reshuffle">换一批</button></h2>
    <p class="col-note">每次打开都不同，任何道场都有同等机会被看见</p>
    <ul class="post-list" id="random-list"><li class="empty">加载中……</li></ul>
    <script type="application/json" id="all-posts">[
      {%- for p in collections.posts_zh -%}
      {%- set pd = p.data.dojo | dojo(collections.dojos_zh) -%}
      {"t":{{ p.data.title | dump | safe }},"u":"{{ p.url }}","d":{{ (pd.data.title if pd else "") | dump | safe }},"a":{{ (p.data.author or "匿名作者") | dump | safe }},"x":{{ p.content | excerpt | dump | safe }}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]</script>
  </section>

  <section class="col">
    <h2>相互推荐</h2>
    <p class="col-note">由其他道场推荐，自荐不计；每个道场每月推荐票有限</p>
    {% set list = collections.posts_zh | recommended(5) %}{% include "partials/post-list.njk" %}
  </section>
</div>

<section class="dojo-strip">
  <h2>各家道场</h2>
  <p class="col-note">已入驻 {{ collections.dojos_zh.length }} 家 · 不问门派与师承，每家道场规则相同 · <a href="/zh/dojos/">全部道场 →</a></p>
  <div class="cards">
  {% for d in collections.dojos_zh %}
    <a class="card{% if d.data.logo %} with-logo{% endif %}" href="{{ d.url }}">{% if d.data.logo %}<img class="card-logo" src="{{ d.data.logo }}" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy">{% endif %}<strong>{{ d.data.title }}</strong><span>{{ d.data.summary }}</span></a>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
